<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">本人基础信息（实时同步医生端）</view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">姓名</view>
      <input class="input" value="{{form.name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">性别</view>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{genders}}" bindchange="onGender">
        <view class="form-value">{{form.gender}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">年龄</view>
      <input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.age}}" data-field="age" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">手机号</view>
      <input class="input" type="number" maxlength="11" value="{{form.phone}}" data-field="phone" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">既往病史</view>
      <textarea class="textarea" value="{{form.pastHistory}}" data-field="pastHistory" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">过敏史</view>
      <textarea class="textarea" value="{{form.allergy}}" data-field="allergy" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">初诊主诉</view>
      <textarea class="textarea" value="{{form.chiefComplaint}}" data-field="chiefComplaint" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="t-xs t-sub">
      说明：医生创建并确认病历后，该条病历将自动锁定，患者端与医生端均不可修改；基础信息可随时自主维护。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="fixed-bottom">
    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" bindtap="onSave">保存</button>
  </view>
</view>
